---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Privacy Policy',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 md:py-16 dark:text-slate-300">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold leading-tighter tracking-tighter mb-4 font-heading dark:text-gray-200">
      Privacy Policy
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-muted mb-2">Anderson CFO LLC ("ACFO")</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted mb-8">Effective Date: March 24, 2026</p>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Introduction</h2>
      <p>
        Anderson CFO LLC ("ACFO," "we," "us," or "our") operates the website
        <a href="https://acfo.co" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 underline">https://acfo.co</a> and provides
        fractional CFO and financial data integration services to our clients. This Privacy Policy describes how we
        collect, use, store, and protect information in connection with our services, including our use of the Amazon
        Selling Partner API ("SP-API").
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Information We Collect</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">We may collect the following categories of information:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
        <li>
          <strong>Client Business Information:</strong> Business name, contact details, merchant identifiers, and financial
          data necessary to provide our services.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Amazon Selling Partner Data:</strong> When authorized by our clients, we access seller data through the
          Amazon Selling Partner API, including order data, inventory data, financial data, catalog data, and related
          business information. This data is collected solely on behalf of and at the direction of our clients.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Website Information:</strong> We may collect standard server logs, including IP addresses, browser type,
          and pages visited when you access our website.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">How We Use Information</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">We use the information we collect to:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
        <li>Provide fractional CFO services to our clients</li>
        <li>Integrate client data with analytics and data warehousing platforms (such as Fivetran and Google BigQuery)</li>
        <li>Generate financial reports and business intelligence</li>
        <li>Comply with applicable legal and regulatory requirements</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Amazon Selling Partner API Data</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">We access Amazon Selling Partner data exclusively on behalf of our authorized clients.</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
        <li>
          We do not sell, rent, or share Amazon Information with any third parties except as necessary to provide our
          contracted services to the authorizing client.
        </li>
        <li>Amazon Information is transmitted and stored using encryption in transit (TLS/HTTPS) and at rest.</li>
        <li>
          We retain Amazon Information only for as long as necessary to fulfill our service obligations to the client, or
          as required by law.
        </li>
        <li>
          We comply with Amazon's Acceptable Use Policy, Data Protection Policy, and the Solution Provider Agreement.
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Data Sharing</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">We do not sell personal information. We share information only with:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
        <li>The client who authorized the data access</li>
        <li>
          Service providers necessary to deliver our services (such as cloud hosting and data warehouse providers)
        </li>
        <li>When required by law, regulation, or legal process</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Data Security</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        We implement appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect information, including:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ml-4">
        <li>Encryption of data in transit and at rest</li>
        <li>Access controls based on job duties and business functions</li>
        <li>Network security controls including firewalls and intrusion detection</li>
        <li>Password policies including multi-factor authentication</li>
        <li>
          An incident response plan with defined roles and 24-hour notification procedures for security incidents
          involving Amazon Information
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Data Retention</h2>
      <p>
        We retain client data only for as long as necessary to provide our services or as required by law. Upon
        termination of a client engagement, we will delete or return client data in accordance with our contractual
        obligations.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Your Rights</h2>
      <p>
        Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights regarding your personal information, including the right to
        access, correct, or delete your data. To exercise any rights, contact us at the information below.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-8">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will post the updated policy on our website with a
        revised effective date.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 dark:text-gray-200">Contact Us</h2>
      <p>Anderson CFO LLC</p>
      <p>
        Email: <a href="mailto:harold@acfo.co" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 underline">harold@acfo.co</a>
      </p>
      <p>
        Website: <a href="https://acfo.co" class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 underline">https://acfo.co</a>
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
